<title>USA: Credence says president to resign.</title>
<headline>Credence says president to resign.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credence Systems Corp said on Tuesday that its president Jim Healy will resign at the end of the month.</p>
<p>Healy will take up the position of chief executive officer at Genus Inc. Credence did not name a replacement.</p>
<p>Credence is a manufacturer of automatic test equipment for the semiconductor industry.</p>
</text>
